OL,3,ALindsay Clancy begged for help before
OL,4,Aher children's killings, mother-in-law
OL,5,Atestifies
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,9,Fattempted suicide
OL,11,FLindsay Clancy was "begging for help"
OL,12,Fbefore killing her three children, her
OL,13,Fformer mother-in-law testified on
OL,14,FTuesday, echoing others who have told a
OL,15,Fcourt that Clancy's mental health
OL,16,Fdeteriorated after the birth of her
OL,17,Fyoungest son.
OL,19,F"She had insomnia. She was losing her
OL,20,Fappetite," the mother-in-law, Susan
OL,21,FClancy, said at the murder trial. "She
OL,22,Fwas very anxious and sad."
