OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers for Clancy, who does not
OL,8,Fdispute carrying out the killings but
OL,9,Fhas pleaded not guilty to murder
OL,10,Fcharges, say she was experiencing
OL,11,Fpostpartum psychosis at the time.
